# Normalise line endings to LF in the repo. Shell scripts and container files break with CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
# Every session adds DECISIONS entries at the top: git's built-in union driver keeps both sides' added lines (DECISIONS).
docs/DECISIONS.md merge=union
